6-10-25" data-tags="fix new up"> <div class="upd-top"><time class="upd-date" datetime="2026-10-25">Oct 25, 2026</time></div> <h3>Playground Basketball</h3> <ul> <li><span class="tag tag-new">New game</span><span><b>Playground Basketball v1.0.8</b> — Pumpkin Farm: teleports to every pumpkin with pathfinding, adjustable walk speed and return to start</span></li> <li><span class="tag tag-new">New game</span><span>Bigger Green Window, Always Can Blow By / Pick Up / Push, Anti Push (all push states), Always Sprint, and No Blow By / Block Cooldown</span></li> <li><span class="tag tag-up">Improved</span><span>New Misc tab (Pumpkin Farm + Banner Mods), a separate Configs tab and a cleaner tab layout</span></li> <li><span class="tag tag-fix">Fix</span><span>Anti Stun now works. Most features have adjustable sliders. <a href="https://youtu.be/-djlwVi47aA" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Watch the showcase</a></span></li> </ul> </article> </div> <a href="/updates/" class="btn-lg btn-lg-outline upd-more">See the full update log (46 updates) →</a> </section> <section class="poll-section" id="vote"> <div class="poll-box"> <span class="eyebrow">Vote</span> <h2 class="poll-h">Which game should we <em>script next?</em></h2> <p class="poll-sub">One vote a day. The top game gets added next.</p> <div class="poll-list" id="pollList"><div class="poll-load">Loading…</div></div> <form class="poll-other" id="pollOther"> <input id="pollCustom" maxlength="60" placeholder="Something else? Type a Roblox game…" autocomplete="off"> <button type="submit">Suggest</button> </form> <div class="poll-msg" id="pollMsg"></div> </div> </section> <style>.poll-section{padding:30px 24px 70px}.poll-box{max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;padding:26px;border-radius:18px;text-align:center;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,.06),rgba(255,255,255,.015)),rgba(14,12,22,.6);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.11);box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.1),0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}.poll-h{font-family:'D