?</summary><p class="faq-a">Percsploit costs $3.99 per day, $6.99 per week, $14.99 per month, or $29.99 one-time for lifetime access. Every plan includes all supported games.</p></details> <details class="faq"><summary>Is there a free Percsploit key?</summary><p class="faq-a">Yes. Free keys for Arcade Basketball and Hoop Nation are available on the Percsploit key system page — pick a game, complete a quick checkpoint and paste your key into the script.</p></details> <details class="faq"><summary>How do I run a Percsploit script?</summary><p class="faq-a">Log in to your Percsploit dashboard, choose your game and press Load or Copy to get your loader with your key built in, then run it in your Roblox executor.</p></details> <details class="faq"><summary>What payment methods does Percsploit accept?</summary><p class="faq-a">Percsploit accepts Visa, Mastercard, American Express, Discover, PayPal and Venmo. If your payment method isn't listed, ask in the Percsploit Discord.</p></details> <details class="faq"><summary>How do I get help with Percsploit?</summary><p class="faq-a">Join the Percsploit Discord at discord.gg/percsploit for support, updates and announcements.</p></details> </div> </section> <div class="gd-overlay" id="gameDetail" aria-hidden="true"> <div class="gd-panel" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="gdTitle"> <button class="gd-close" type="button" aria-label="Close">&times;</button> <div class="gd-hero"> <img id="gdImg" alt=""> <div class="gd-hero-text"> <span class="gd-chip" id="gdCat"></span> <h3 class="gd-title" id="gdTitle"></h3> <p class="gd-sub" id="gdSub"></p> </div> </div> <div class="gd-body"> <div class="gd-stats"> <div class="gd-stat"><div class="gd-stat-v" id="gdCount"></div><div class="gd-stat-l">Features</div></div> <div class="gd-stat"><div class="gd-stat-v">1 key</div><div class="gd-stat-l">Works on every game</div></div> <div class="gd-stat"><div class="gd-stat-v">All plans</div><div class="gd-stat-l">Included in</div></div> 